WEBVTT

00:11:58.831 --> 00:12:00.794
but it was an amazing thing.

00:12:01.452 --> 00:12:05.323
And I'm going, what do I do
with this notoriety

00:12:05.347 --> 00:12:06.791
that the book has brought?

00:12:07.801 --> 00:12:11.055
And, being a pastor,
I started reading the Bible.

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.379
There's a chapter in the Bible
called Psalm 72,

00:12:14.403 --> 00:12:18.148
and it's Solomon's prayer
for more influence.

00:12:18.172 --> 00:12:19.976
When you read this prayer,

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.960
it sounds incredibly
selfish, self-centered.

00:12:24.023 --> 00:12:26.559
He says, "God, I want you
to make me famous."

00:12:26.583 --> 00:12:28.023
That's what he prays.

00:12:28.047 --> 00:12:29.914
He said, "I want you to make me famous.

00:12:29.938 --> 00:12:32.771
I want you to spread the fame
of my name through every land,